    // A Float / Rational / Complex is a BOX for the same reason, and two boxes of
    // one value are two objects, while llvm.Run's jsFlo is a Go VALUE struct
    // that == compares field by field - so `[1.0] == [1.0]` needs this arm to be
    // true natively too. rbEq settles two numbers without reaching this function
    // again.
