// ===================================================== classes ==============

// ----- The PER-OBJECT singleton method table -----
//
// Ruby gives every object a singleton ("eigen") class in front of its own class.
// `def obj.m', a def inside `class << obj' and #define_singleton_method write the
// __sing slot (name -> closure, with __singn holding the names in definition
