// plain fail() is an ENGINE abort no rescue clause can see. frame names the
// builtin method that raised, for js_rsite; "" when it is not known. Mirrors
// rubyRaiseErr of abnf/jsrt.go and raiseErr of ruby-interpreter.abnf.
