// a number. A String box is its text to every operator but <<, which appends in
// place - answered here, off the numeric path, which pays a MetaJS frame per
// test. Twin of the jsRStr arm of rubyBin in abnf/jsrt.go.
function rbNonNumBin(op, l, r) {
